screens.prose:
A quote's bid must stay below its ask. In Python, any code may set `q.bid` to anything. Here is a C++ `struct` doing the same job.

```cpp
struct Quote {
    double bid;
    double ask;
};

Quote q{100.2, 100.4};
q.bid = 100.6;   // meant 100.16
std::cout << q.ask - q.bid << '\n';
```

